<!--
  Boxes whose alpha range leaves the grid's [0, 2 pi] lines, on a closed
  cylindrical cavity with the axis (rho 0..6 mm, 12 alpha cells, z 0..8 mm):
  a lossy dielectric over alpha -0.5..2 (openEMS: [0, 2] only, not the
  cells below 2 pi nor the seam), a dielectric, magnetic box over the axis
  with alpha pi..3 pi (openEMS: from the cell below pi up to 2 pi, its
  alpha = 0 line of the seam H_alpha outside), and a box over alpha 0..2
  (openEMS: not on the seam). Probes on the seam, next to it and on the
  axis ring.
  Hand-written for the ems cylindrical fixtures (scripts/openems-oracle/gen-cyl.sh).
-->
